{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7e0087225bc9e4a8d83980129bf316ebe239d680b94a92cfe96f502a2d4d20c9","ja":"最後の投稿","zh":"最后的发帖","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ed152e42fbbfcaab4dca90f7a91b0d0ad6bed9cd2d926705ea769ef3ea051cb4","ja":"そんで、衣装に着替えたってことは、\n最後の投稿をどうするか決まったん？","zh":"既然都换上演出服装了，\n也就是说最后一条动态该怎么发已经定下来了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1f0af06528b6d9179533c1959f0dec26807790a6f69e50c4ee6d5bdd147bdcc7","ja":"はい～。動画で、なるとしてネタバラシをしつつ\n「明日からは美也に戻ります」と、宣言しようかと～。","zh":"好的～。我想在视频里以“成”的身份揭晓真相，\n顺便宣布“明天起就变回美也”呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"379f1d068c633403b1cb7561384805c588e88e02cfc2867c2b7b39cd1254ccb3","ja":"あははっ！　なんや「普通の女の子に戻ります！」\nみたいやな！","zh":"啊哈哈！简直就像\n“我要回归普通的女孩子了！”一样呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f362ca8967ee9554b466f1a92258334df79fb604a07d85c92102f70759f9df6c","ja":"ほな、撮影は私がやるから、美也はそこに立ってて。\n……よーい、スタート！","zh":"那我来拍，美也你站在那里就好。\n……预备，开始！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"17adf00f5e0460840343b104d4309da1b6cdc08911b2eac3ed895738101b2ce4","ja":"「今日の投稿、みんな読んでくれてたかな？\nきっとビックリしたよね。ごめんなさい」","zh":"「今天的发帖，大家都有看吗？\n肯定吓了一跳吧。对不起」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3133f65a05febc93fbc520397b82ec16953e1e3c1b0dace3874a5e2d56528122","ja":"「でも、なるが投稿するのはこれでおしまい。\n明日からは元通りだから、安心してください」","zh":"“不过，鸣发帖就到此为止啦。\n明天开始就会恢复原样，请大家放心”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"41966b7079b0e0438844c987c8dc3dbbcabf8b9abba65978bd79b9091838cd6a","ja":"……というわけで、改めまして、宮尾美也です～。\n今日限定の特別企画、楽しんでいただけましたか～？","zh":"……就是这样，再次自我介绍一下，我是宫尾美也～。\n仅限今天的特别企划，大家玩得开心吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5f6632bb018fb9963f27a0faa80f9add28e21ef368dc412d771d940f16c0db16","ja":"私の演じるなるが、みなさんに好評だったので、\nなるになりきって投稿してみました～♪","zh":"我饰演的小鸣受到了大家的好评，\n所以就完全化身为小鸣来发文啦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"850f7fc82725df62838f9a7b56ca1d569aa829a50d9406be3dbfb911c0e2a278","ja":"なるの投稿は今日だけとなりますが……\nこれからも、応援よろしくお願いしますね～。","zh":"小成的发帖就只有今天了……\n之后也请大家多多支持哦～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e92922f26a41b93d96b1b4f481e360a60049815822c382c059e7511e3f5622d5","ja":"はい、OK！　さっそく投稿して……っと。","zh":"好，搞定！这就发出去……好啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"1d42ffec2a63dec25d5a6d603474ce50cfb295cc82877c6ded8f1e7d5598e3a0","ja":"うわっ。あげた途端、\n再生数がガンガン増えてくやん！","zh":"哇。才刚发出去，\n播放量就蹭蹭地往上涨啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"cf8a4f88991818fca039f8e2303742fcdd5ab1dbd711d12e9db38b7df71559fc","ja":"「またやってほしい」\n「今度は他の子のなりきり投稿も見たい！」","zh":"“希望下次还能办”\n“下次还想看其他孩子的角色扮演投稿！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"988ab0a028d4dcca089ec5729e9521eb4e90ffbb68e268c211496a22bf60af04","ja":"お～、嬉しい反響ですな～。","zh":"哦～，这反响真让人高兴呀～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"9f4c3d7215351354edaf19ff9b837d8353c73e4fb48501969ca51f0cc8395565","ja":"これだけ好評なんやったら、\n恒例の企画にすんのも、アリなんとちゃう？","zh":"既然这么受欢迎，\n作为常规企划来做不也是挺好的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"79926fdea035b03f5a1a703f3ee35fa57af39073a68ba5fa857af998ed05a074","ja":"いいですな～。私も賛成です～。","zh":"真不错呢～。我也赞成～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"01a5ff897d8a43d3e31a83d893d9734d40513e67b5f07d372ea35a40c8732ef8","ja":"そうと決まれば、●●●●プロデューサーさんに\n相談や！　鉄は熱いうちに打たなアカン！ってな♪","zh":"既然决定好了，那就去跟●●●●制作人\n商量吧！趁热要打铁嘛♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1474.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"3ff23b91d176806c6928196bb89fa1cf7ec502a208fd97b48eb866dac6734ced","ja":"公演は終わりましたけど……ファンのみなさんと、\n新しい楽しみ方ができましたね～。むふふ♪","zh":"演出虽然结束了……不过和粉丝朋友们\n一起发现了新的乐趣呢～。哼哼哼♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
